                <pb facs="0116" n="36" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg36"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Wilson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-07-15"><hi rendition="#italic">July 15,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The President of the United States conveys through you to the Government and the
                    family of the late President Errázuriz his sincere sympathy.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
